{"seq":4,"slug":"sdk-quickstart","title":"SDK 快速入门指南","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/technical-writing/api-documentation/sdk-quickstart","wordCount":1052,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"sdk-快速入门指南\">SDK 快速入门指南</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>快速入门指南（Quickstart）的目标只有一个：<strong>让开发者在 5 分钟内完成一次成功的 API 调用</strong>。它是用户与产品之间的第一次握手，任何一处卡顿都可能让开发者放弃接入。</p>\n<p>快速入门与完整文档的定位不同——它刻意省略细节，只保留打通「第一次调用」所需的最短路径：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>最短路径</strong>：前置条件 → 安装 → 认证 → 首次调用 → 下一步，每步只保留必要信息</li>\n<li><strong>可复制</strong>：所有命令和代码都能直接运行，不依赖读者脑补</li>\n<li><strong>可验证</strong>：每一步都有明确的成功标志，让读者确认自己在正确轨道上</li>\n<li><strong>语言对等</strong>：所有支持的 SDK 语言提供等价示例，不让任何一方读者被冷落</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[前置条件] --&gt; B[安装 SDK]&#10;    B --&gt; C[配置认证]&#10;    C --&gt; D[首次 API 调用]&#10;    D --&gt; E{成功?}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[下一步: 深入探索]&#10;    E --&gt;|否| G[启用调试日志]&#10;    G --&gt; D\">graph LR\n    A[前置条件] --&gt; B[安装 SDK]\n    B --&gt; C[配置认证]\n    C --&gt; D[首次 API 调用]\n    D --&gt; E{成功?}\n    E --&gt;|是| F[下一步: 深入探索]\n    E --&gt;|否| G[启用调试日志]\n    G --&gt; D</pre><p>关键取舍是：宁可让快速入门短到略显单薄，也不要塞进进阶内容——深度属于后面的指南和参考文档。</p>\n<h2 id=\"快速入门模板结构\">快速入门模板结构</h2><p>一份高质量的 SDK 快速入门指南应让开发者在 5 分钟内完成首次 API 调用：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>章节</th>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>预期阅读时间</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>前置条件</td>\n<td>明确环境要求与准备工作</td>\n<td>30 秒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安装</td>\n<td>安装 SDK 并验证</td>\n<td>1 分钟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>认证配置</td>\n<td>获取并配置 API 密钥</td>\n<td>1 分钟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首次调用</td>\n<td>成功执行第一个 API 请求</td>\n<td>2 分钟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>下一步</td>\n<td>引导开发者深入探索</td>\n<td>30 秒</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"安装说明\">安装说明</h2><p>安装部分应覆盖所有支持的语言和包管理器：</p>\n<h3 id=\"node-js\">Node.js</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npm install @example/sdk\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @example/sdk</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"python\">Python</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"pip install example-sdk\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pip</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> example-sdk</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"go\">Go</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"go get github.com/example/sdk-go\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">go</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> get</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> github.com/example/sdk-go</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"java\">Java</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"xml\" data-code=\"&lt;dependency&gt;&#10;  &lt;groupId&gt;com.example&lt;/groupId&gt;&#10;  &lt;artifactId&gt;sdk-java&lt;/artifactId&gt;&#10;  &lt;version&gt;2.1.0&lt;/version&gt;&#10;&lt;/dependency&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">dependency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">groupId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>com.example&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">groupId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">artifactId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>sdk-java&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">artifactId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>2.1.0&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">dependency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"环境要求\">环境要求</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语言</th>\n<th>最低版本</th>\n<th>包管理器</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Node.js</td>\n<td>18.0+</td>\n<td>npm / yarn / pnpm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Python</td>\n<td>3.9+</td>\n<td>pip / poetry</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Go</td>\n<td>1.21+</td>\n<td>go modules</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Java</td>\n<td>17+</td>\n<td>Maven / Gradle</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"认证配置\">认证配置</h2><h3 id=\"获取-api-密钥\">获取 API 密钥</h3><ol>\n<li>登录 <a href=\"https://console.example.com\">开发者控制台</a></li>\n<li>进入「API 密钥」页面</li>\n<li>点击「创建密钥」，选择所需权限范围</li>\n<li>复制生成的密钥，妥善保管</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"配置方式\">配置方式</h3><p>推荐使用环境变量配置密钥，避免硬编码：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"export EXAMPLE_API_KEY=&quot;sk_live_your_api_key_here&quot;&#10;export EXAMPLE_API_BASE=&quot;https://api.example.com/v2&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> EXAMPLE_API_KEY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sk_live_your_api_key_here\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> EXAMPLE_API_BASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://api.example.com/v2\"</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配置方式</th>\n<th>安全性</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>环境变量</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>生产环境、CI/CD</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配置文件 (.env)</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>本地开发（需加入 .gitignore）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码硬编码</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>仅限快速验证，严禁用于生产</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"首次-api-调用\">首次 API 调用</h2><p>以「获取当前用户信息」为例，展示各语言的首次调用：</p>\n<h3 id=\"node-js\">Node.js</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"import { ExampleClient } from &#39;@example/sdk&#39;;&#10;&#10;const client = new ExampleClient({&#10;  apiKey: process.env.EXAMPLE_API_KEY,&#10;});&#10;&#10;const user = await client.users.getCurrent();&#10;console.log(`你好, ${user.name}!`);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ExampleClient } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@example/sdk'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> client</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ExampleClient</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  apiKey: process.env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">EXAMPLE_API_KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> user</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> client.users.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getCurrent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`你好, ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">user</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}!`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"python\">Python</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from example_sdk import ExampleClient&#10;&#10;client = ExampleClient(api_key=os.environ[&quot;EXAMPLE_API_KEY&quot;])&#10;&#10;user = client.users.get_current()&#10;print(f&quot;你好, {user.name}!&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> example_sdk </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ExampleClient</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">client </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ExampleClient(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">api_key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">os.environ[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EXAMPLE_API_KEY\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">user </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> client.users.get_current()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"你好, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">user.name</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">!\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"go\">Go</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"package main&#10;&#10;import (&#10;\t&quot;fmt&quot;&#10;\t&quot;os&quot;&#10;&#10;\texample &quot;github.com/example/sdk-go&quot;&#10;)&#10;&#10;func main() {&#10;\tclient := example.NewClient(os.Getenv(&quot;EXAMPLE_API_KEY&quot;))&#10;&#10;\tuser, err := client.Users.GetCurrent()&#10;\tif err != nil {&#10;\t\tpanic(err)&#10;\t}&#10;\tfmt.Printf(&quot;你好, %s!\\n&quot;, user.Name)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">package</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\t\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fmt</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\t\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">os</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\texample </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-