\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"请求配置与超时\">请求配置与超时</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const client = new ExampleClient({&#10;  apiKey: process.env.EXAMPLE_API_KEY,&#10;  timeout: 10000,&#10;  retries: 3,&#10;  baseURL: &#39;https://api.example.com/v2&#39;,&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> client</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ExampleClient</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  apiKey: process.env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">EXAMPLE_API_KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  timeout: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  retries: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  baseURL: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://api.example.com/v2'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"调试技巧\">调试技巧</h2><h3 id=\"启用调试日志\">启用调试日志</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语言</th>\n<th>启用方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Node.js</td>\n<td><code>EXAMPLE_DEBUG=true node app.js</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Python</td>\n<td><code>logging.basicConfig(level=logging.DEBUG)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Go</td>\n<td><code>client.SetDebug(true)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Java</td>\n<td><code>-Dexample.debug=true</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"常见问题排查\">常见问题排查</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>可能原因</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>AUTH_TOKEN_INVALID</code></td>\n<td>API 密钥错误或未配置</td>\n<td>检查环境变量是否正确设置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ETIMEDOUT</code></td>\n<td>网络不可达</td>\n<td>确认网络连接与防火墙配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>SSL_ERROR</code></td>\n<td>证书验证失败</td>\n<td>更新系统根证书或检查代理设置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>RATE_LIMIT_EXCEEDED</code></td>\n<td>请求频率超限</td>\n<td>启用 SDK 内置的自动重试机制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>响应数据为空</td>\n<td>权限不足</td>\n<td>确认 API 密钥包含所需 scope</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"请求追踪\">请求追踪</h3><p>每个 SDK 调用都会生成唯一的 <code>requestId</code>，排查问题时提供该 ID 可加速定位：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"try {&#10;  await client.users.getCurrent();&#10;} catch (error) {&#10;  console.error(`请联系技术支持，提供请求 ID: ${error.requestId}`);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> client.users.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getCurrent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (error) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`请联系技术支持，提供请求 ID: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">error</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">requestId</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>单例模式</strong>：全局复用同一个 client 实例，避免重复创建连接</li>\n<li><strong>环境隔离</strong>：使用不同的 API 密钥区分开发、测试、生产环境</li>\n<li><strong>版本锁定</strong>：在 lock 文件中锁定 SDK 版本，避免意外升级</li>\n<li><strong>及时更新</strong>：关注 SDK 变更日志，及时升级以获取新功能与修复</li>\n<li><strong>密钥轮换</strong>：定期轮换 API 密钥，被泄露时立即吊销</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>快速入门的目标是让开发者在 5 分钟内完成第一次成功调用，深度留给后续文档</li>\n<li>结构遵循前置条件、安装、认证、首次调用、下一步的最短路径</li>\n<li>安装与示例覆盖所有支持的语言，保证各类读者体验对等</li>\n<li>密钥通过环境变量配置，避免硬编码，生产环境尤为关键</li>\n<li>提供调试日志开关和常见问题排查表，帮助开发者自助定位</li>\n<li>后续实践强调单例复用、环境隔离、版本锁定与密钥轮换</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"SDK 快速入门指南","id":"sdk-快速入门指南"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"快速入门模板结构","id":"快速入门模板结构"},{"level":2,"text":"安装说明","id":"安装说明"},{"level":3,"text":"Node.js","id":"node-js"},{"level":3,"text":"Python","id":"python"},{"level":3,"text":"Go","id":"go"},{"level":3,"text":"Java","id":"java"},{"level":3,"text":"环境要求","id":"环境要求"},{"level":2,"text":"认证配置","id":"认证配置"},{"level":3,"text":"获取 API 密钥","id":"获取-api-密钥"},{"level":3,"text":"配置方式","id":"配置方式"},{"level":2,"text":"首次 API 调用","id":"首次-api-调用"},{"level":3,"text":"Node.js","id":"node-js"},{"level":3,"text":"Python","id":"python"},{"level":3,"text":"Go","id":"go"},{"level":3,"text":"Java","id":"java"},{"level":2,"text":"常用模式","id":"常用模式"},{"level":3,"text":"列表遍历与分页","id":"列表遍历与分页"},{"level":3,"text":"错误处理","id":"错误处理"},{"level":3,"text":"请求配置与超时","id":"请求配置与超时"},{"level":2,"text":"调试技巧","id":"调试技巧"},{"level":3,"text":"启用调试日志","id":"启用调试日志"},{"level":3,"text":"常见问题排查","id":"常见问题排查"},{"level":3,"text":"请求追踪","id":"请求追踪"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"错误码文档","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/technical-writing/api-documentation/error-codes"},"next":{"title":"README 最佳实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/technical-writing/project-documentation/readme-best-practices"}}